      "updated": 1790067719209,
      "created": 1790010368706,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. FRONTEND INVESTIGATION SETUP (Windows Host)\n• Query: User enters search terms (e.g. \"stolen cards Mumbai\", \"ak47 escrow\").\n• Search Providers: Selects active engines (Ahmia, Torch, Tor66, Curated Seeds).\n• Target URL Limit (Max Onions): Number of unique .onion sites to shortlist (default: 5).\n• Crawl Depth (Max Depth): How deep to follow subpages (Depth 1 = landing only, Depth 2+ = follows\nlinks).",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. FRONTEND INVESTIGATION SETUP (Windows Host)\n• Query: User enters search terms (e.g. \"stolen cards Mumbai\", \"ak47 escrow\").\n• Search Providers: Selects active engines (Ahmia, Torch, Tor66, Curated Seeds).\n• Target URL Limit (Max Onions): Number of unique .onion sites to shortlist (default: 5).\n• Crawl Depth (Max Depth): How deep to follow subpages (Depth 1 = landing only, Depth 2+ = follows links).",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
