      "updated": 1790067719209,
      "created": 1790010590404,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Then this opencode session has been made. This opencode session is\nlinked with this job forever for his entire life.\n\nNow the user entered his query with the other information, such as the\nmax URL and the depth. We go ahead and use opencode and give him a\nprompt like: \"You are an Tro AI agent whose job right now is to create\nfan-out queries to search on the dark web for the original user query\ngiven below and then replace the user query with the original query.\"\n\nIn the frontend we will also add this: along with max onion URLs, the user\ncan also select the number of fan-out queries. The default is 3. Opencode\nwill also get that to create 3 or 4, depending on what the user has\nselected, fan-out queries for the original query. Opencode will give a valid\nJSON containing just the queries, 3 queries for example if it is set to\ndefault.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "dOPErUac_104cQ24VOrVE",
      "originalText": "Then this opencode session has been made. This opencode session is linked with this job forever for his entire life.\n\nNow the user entered his query with the other information, such as the max URL and the depth. We go ahead and use opencode and give him a prompt like: \"You are an Tro AI agent whose job right now is to create fan-out queries to search on the dark web for the original user query given below and then replace the user query with the original query.\"\n\nIn the frontend we will also add this: along with max onion URLs, the user can also select the number of fan-out queries. The default is 3. Opencode will also get that to create 3 or 4, depending on what the user has selected, fan-out queries for the original query. Opencode will give a valid JSON containing just the queries, 3 queries for example if it is set to default.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
