      "updated": 1790067719209,
      "created": 1790010714321,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "2. DARK WEB SEARCH & SHORTLISTING (Whonix VM)\n• Whonix Daemon: Picks up job_<id>.json from shared folder.\n• Search Queries: Fires each fanout query sequence, like fanout query number 1 in Ahmia, gets the target\nURLs the user selected and then the second fanout query on Ahmia, and then the third, and so on across\nchosen search engines (Ahmia, Torch, Tor66).[Default engine is Ahmia but we have also kept other engines\nnot added yet in the code because Ahmia gives, most of the time, 504 error]\n• URL Deduplication:\n  - Scans search results using regex for 56-character v3 .onion domains.\n  - Drops duplicate addresses, malformed links, and search engine self-links.\n• Shortlist Cap: Keeps strictly up to Max Onions unique sites; drops the rest.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "2. DARK WEB SEARCH & SHORTLISTING (Whonix VM)\n• Whonix Daemon: Picks up job_<id>.json from shared folder.\n• Search Queries: Fires each fanout query sequence, like fanout query number 1 in Ahmia, gets the target URLs the user selected and then the second fanout query on Ahmia, and then the third, and so on across chosen search engines (Ahmia, Torch, Tor66).[Default engine is Ahmia but we have also kept other engines not added yet in the code because Ahmia gives, most of the time, 504 error]\n• URL Deduplication:\n  - Scans search results using regex for 56-character v3 .onion domains.\n  - Drops duplicate addresses, malformed links, and search engine self-links.\n• Shortlist Cap: Keeps strictly up to Max Onions unique sites; drops the rest.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
