    {
      "id": "J7HIxt4z4pcI91lrYD_Bf",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2418,
      "y": 156,
      "width": 484,
      "height": 222,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bFy",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1404090771,
      "version": 229,
      "versionNonce": 304253891,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "id": "4BAs9s3L1lschZCetRKsa",
          "type": "arrow"
        }
      ],
      "updated": 1790067719209,
      "created": 1790010800247,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "3. DEEP CRAWL & EVIDENCE SCRAPING (Whonix VM)\n• Engine: Standard Python urllib routed through Whonix Tor SOCKS (10.152.152.10:9050). No pip/httpx\nneeded.\n• Outbound Link Handling (Controlled by Max Depth):\n  - Max Depth = 1: Crawls only the landing page. Outbound links are recorded but NOT followed.\n  - Max Depth = 2+: Queues internal links (same onion domain) for subpage scraping. External links recorded.\n• Captured Fields (JSON Schema):\n  url, onion_address, title, cleaned_text, raw_html, raw_content_hash (SHA-256),\n  template_hash, http_status, byte_size, response_headers, meta_tags, outbound_links,\n  image_urls, asset_urls, scrape_timestamp.\n\nYou remember the folder we created \nafter step one for opencode, all of this thing that we scraped for each unique onion link will be stored in the\ndatabase. At the same time it also will be stored in a file structure, like in that folder with the proper structure\nof files and stuff. \n",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "3. DEEP CRAWL & EVIDENCE SCRAPING (Whonix VM)\n• Engine: Standard Python urllib routed through Whonix Tor SOCKS (10.152.152.10:9050). No pip/httpx needed.\n• Outbound Link Handling (Controlled by Max Depth):\n  - Max Depth = 1: Crawls only the landing page. Outbound links are recorded but NOT followed.\n  - Max Depth = 2+: Queues internal links (same onion domain) for subpage scraping. External links recorded.\n• Captured Fields (JSON Schema):\n  url, onion_address, title, cleaned_text, raw_html, raw_content_hash (SHA-256),\n  template_hash, http_status, byte_size, response_headers, meta_tags, outbound_links,\n  image_urls, asset_urls, scrape_timestamp.\n\nYou remember the folder we created \nafter step one for opencode, all of this thing that we scraped for each unique onion link will be stored in the database. At the same time it also will be stored in a file structure, like in that folder with the proper structure of files and stuff. \n",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
