      "updated": 1790067719209,
      "created": 1790064077430,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "4. LOCKSMITH ENGINE: INFRASTRUCTURE & IP UNMASKING (Host)\n• Input: response_headers, raw_html, favicon.ico bytes from scraped pages.\n• Favicon MMH3 Hash:\n  - Computes 32-bit MurmurHash3 of favicon -> generates Shodan dork: http.favicon.hash:<hash>.\n  - Unmasks clearnet IP addresses hosting the same web application or forum icon!\n• Leaked IP Finder: Scans HTML/text for non-private IPv4 addresses (clearnet server leaks, /server-status).\n• Shodan InternetDB: Queries free API (internetdb.shodan.io) for open ports, hostnames, and known CVEs.\n• Output: Extracted server banners, ETags, favicon hashes, and enriched IP leak records.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "4. LOCKSMITH ENGINE: INFRASTRUCTURE & IP UNMASKING (Host)\n• Input: response_headers, raw_html, favicon.ico bytes from scraped pages.\n• Favicon MMH3 Hash:\n  - Computes 32-bit MurmurHash3 of favicon -> generates Shodan dork: http.favicon.hash:<hash>.\n  - Unmasks clearnet IP addresses hosting the same web application or forum icon!\n• Leaked IP Finder: Scans HTML/text for non-private IPv4 addresses (clearnet server leaks, /server-status).\n• Shodan InternetDB: Queries free API (internetdb.shodan.io) for open ports, hostnames, and known CVEs.\n• Output: Extracted server banners, ETags, favicon hashes, and enriched IP leak records.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
