      "updated": 1790067719209,
      "created": 1790066313746,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "5. STYLOMETRY & OPSEC PROFILER (Host)\n• Input: cleaned_text (>100 words) and timestamps of dark web forum/vendor listings.\n• Vector Extraction:\n  - Frequencies of top 50 subconscious function words (the, of, and, in, with...).\n  - Average word length, vocabulary richness (Yule's K), and punctuation density.\n• Authorship Attribution (Burrows' Delta):\n  - Cross-compares writing styles across different onion sites.\n  - If similarity > 0.75, generates LIKELY_SAME_AUTHOR edge linking the personas!\n• OpSec Leaks: Catches clearnet slips (ProtonMail, GitHub, usernames) & analyzes posting hours for UTC timezone.\n• Output: OpSec Score (0-100), timezone estimate, and stylometric cross-comparison dossier.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "5. STYLOMETRY & OPSEC PROFILER (Host)\n• Input: cleaned_text (>100 words) and timestamps of dark web forum/vendor listings.\n• Vector Extraction:\n  - Frequencies of top 50 subconscious function words (the, of, and, in, with...).\n  - Average word length, vocabulary richness (Yule's K), and punctuation density.\n• Authorship Attribution (Burrows' Delta):\n  - Cross-compares writing styles across different onion sites.\n  - If similarity > 0.75, generates LIKELY_SAME_AUTHOR edge linking the personas!\n• OpSec Leaks: Catches clearnet slips (ProtonMail, GitHub, usernames) & analyzes posting hours for UTC timezone.\n• Output: OpSec Score (0-100), timezone estimate, and stylometric cross-comparison dossier.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
